    /**
     * The advance of every monospaced face, in units per em.
     *
     * A monospaced face needs one number rather than a table: every character in
     * one advances by the same amount, so the face's advance is the width of all
     * of them. The bold cut of one is the same amount again.
     *
     * | Face | Clone |
     * | --- | --- |
     * | Consolas | DMCA Sans Serif |
     * | JetBrains Mono | JetBrains Mono |
     * | Menlo | DejaVu Sans Mono |
     *
     * @var array<string, int>
     */
    public const MONOSPACED = [
        'Consolas' => 550,
        'JetBrains Mono' => 600,
        'Menlo' => 602,
    ];

    /**
     * The face a theme naming one with no table is measured with.
     *
     * Its widths are the ones every face was measured with before there were tables
     * of their own, so a deck naming an unusual face is laid out as it was before
     * rather than as something else.
     */
    public const REFERENCE = 'Arial';
